<title>USA: CTG, Koch acquire Bay State Gas affiliate.</title>
<headline>CTG, Koch acquire Bay State Gas affiliate.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CTG Resources Inc said Wednesday that it and Koch Gas Services Co have acquired the partnership interest in KBC Energy Services from Bay State Gas Co's affiliate, Bay State Energy Enterprises.</p>
<p>Koch Gas is a unit of privately-held Koch Industries Inc. Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>KBC Energy Services, said the company, markets natural gas supplies and energy related services on an unregulated basis in New England, New Jersey and Long Island, N.Y.</p>
